#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:4
msgid "OpenMV Boards"
msgstr "Papan OpenMV"

#: ../../openmvcam/quickref.rst:6
msgid ""
"OpenMV cameras and Arduino boards running OpenMV firmware. Each page has the"
" full pinout, peripheral mapping, supported drivers, and board-specific "
"notes."
msgstr ""
"Kamera OpenMV dan papan Arduino yang menjalankan firmware OpenMV. Setiap "
"halaman memiliki pinout lengkap, pemetaan periferal, driver yang didukung, "
"dan catatan khusus papan."

